陷虜，處以大匠之官。今為副使，必欲模範宮闕。豈可令氈鄉之鄙，取象天宮？臣謂且留少游，令使主反命。」世祖以非和通意，不許。少游，安樂人。虜宮室制度，皆從其出。","reading":"蔣少游先任大匠，作副使，崔元祖自稱舅。是否留人在兩國使聘背景中處置。","note":"蔣少游先任大匠，作副使，崔元祖自稱舅。是否留人在兩國使聘背景中處置。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":137,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:variant_review21-42","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"00s_apz_hbu","source_quote":"少游，臣之外甥","reading":"清河崔元祖自言外甥，蔣少游安樂人，工宮室；保留使主李道固與副使的次序。","note":"清河崔元祖自言外甥，蔣少游安樂人，工宮室；保留使主李道固與副使的次序。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021","start_codepoint":42,"end_codepoint":49,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021:m0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"蔣少游","kind":"person","person_id":"00s_apz_hbu","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"少游","kind":"person","person_id":"00s_apz_hbu","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"少游","kind":"person","person_id":"00s_apz_hbu","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-